{"ticker":"HUM","updated":"2026-10-30T22:52:55Z","profile":{"longName":"Humana Inc.","shortName":"Humana Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Healthcare Plans","country":"United States","website":"https://www.humana.com","fullTimeEmployees":67060,"marketCap":49773285376,"trailingPE":39.177692,"forwardPE":24.256334,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.34166408,"pegRatio":1.15,"targetMeanPrice":465.125,"targetHighPrice":596.0,"targetLowPrice":280.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.262,"earningsGrowth":0.271,"grossMargins":0.13653,"operatingMargins":0.034649998,"profitMargins":0.00878,"totalRevenue":145679007744,"beta":0.744,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":456.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":163.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.85},"summary":"Humana Inc. provides medical and specialty insurance products in the United States. It operates in two segments, Insurance and CenterWell. The Insurance segment offers individual Medicare Advantage products, including health insurance benefits, including wellness programs, chronic care management, and care coordination; individual Medicare stand-alone prescription drug products (PDP); group Medicare advantage and Medicare stand-alone PDP; Medicare supplements; specialty and ancillary insurance comprising dental, vision, life and disability; and administrative services to arrange health care services for active-duty and retired military personnel and dependents, as well as pharmacy benefit managers. Its CenterWell segment operates full-service, value-based senior focused primary care centers under the Conviva Senior Primary Care and CenterWell Senior Primary Care brands; a management services organization; CenterWell Home Health, a home health provider; and OneHome, which manages post-acute patient needs, as well as provides pharmacy and hospice solutions. The company was formerly known as Extendicare Inc. and changed its name to Humana Inc. in April 1974. Humana Inc. was founded in 1961 and is headquartered in Louisville, Kentucky.","summary_zh":"Humana Inc. 在美國提供醫療和專業保險產品。它分為兩個部門：保險部門和 CenterWell 部門。保險部門提供個人醫療保險優勢產品，包括健康保險福利，包括健康計劃、長期護理管理和護理協調；個人 Medicare 獨立處方藥產品 (PDP)；團體醫療保險優勢和醫療保險獨立 PDP；醫療保險補助；專業和輔助保險，包括牙科、視力、人壽和殘疾；行政服務，為現役和退役軍人及其家屬以及藥物福利經理安排醫療保健服務。其 CenterWell 部門以 Conviva Senior Primary Care 和 CenterWell Senior Primary Care 品牌營運提供全方位服務、以價值為基礎的老年初級保健中心；管理服務組織； CenterWell Home Health，一家家庭健康提供者； OneHome 負責管理急性期患者的需求，並提供藥房和臨終關懷解決方案。該公司前身為 Extendicare Inc.，於 1974 年 4 月更名為 Humana Inc.。 Humana Inc. 成立於 1961 年，總部位於肯塔基州路易斯維爾。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療保健計劃","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":304.59,"h":314.28,"l":303.01,"c":310.06,"v":1966100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":308.91,"h":314.28,"l":306.14,"c":311.98,"v":1739400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":310.93,"h":313.71,"l":308.02,"c":312.0,"v":1621300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":311.46,"h":315.35,"l":306.53,"c":307.92,"v":1504600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":309.9,"h":311.59,"l":302.77,"c":310.38,"v":1147300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":312.14,"h":314.54,"l":271.2,"c":273.02,"v":4844000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":270.01,"h":273.87,"l":254.0,"c":273.58,"v":4315700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":275.71,"h":282.49,"l":271.02,"c":278.72,"v":2057000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":276.99,"h":279.94,"l":274.2,"c":276.44,"v":1138400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":275.3,"h":276.9,"l":271.1,"c":275.42,"v":1277600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":272.0,"h":273.5,"l":264.84,"c":272.32,"v":2637100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":273.0,"h":273.85,"l":267.66,"c":269.39,"v":1491900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":270.24,"h":272.0,"l":264.8,"c":264.86,"v":1355100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":263.69,"h":263.69,"l":250.24,"c":252.66,"v":4957800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":250.8,"h":258.58,"l":248.5,"c":257.87,"v":1927000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":257.53,"h":262.63,"l":256.29,"c":258.32,"v":1612900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":257.72,"h":263.4,"l":257.72,"c":261.97,"v":1569100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":262.0,"h":263.29,"l":252.68,"c":254.43,"v":2208600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":256.2,"h":257.93,"l":253.16,"c":2