N0YtQ0l5S2h5NXpnRlFYR1k5UC1yR3VNdTNGODVHTXFzX3BKSnNkNEJKTUR1NW9hRG9JQ0hQb3RJbWdZVXVYOXJoVVFkS1hNTzZpNk0xMGlSYk1mUGFSQ2ZMczJSOTdLRTBYVGllNVR4TmNlY080V1dGUzVWYThYV1NmLXZIejBLeXZSbkJsWXJRT1J0cFljNWZ2c0lPTWtLT2gxZE0zUF9DaGVYUWdwUU9pY2E4YWhEZkpwWHJwNFg1SlpXdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"Humana 的貝萊德交易、Village Medical 的資產剝離預示著老年人初級保健"},{"title":"BlackRock buys Welsh Carson's $2.8bn Humana clinic stake; Grafine, Atlantic Ridge agree $900m Paragon Films deal","src":"AltAssets Private Equity News","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"貝萊德 (BlackRock) 收購威爾斯卡森 (Welsh Carson) 價值 28 億美元的 Humana 診所股份； Grafine 與 Atlantic Ridge 就 Paragon Films 達成 9 億美元交易"},{"title":"BlackRock replaces WCAS in joint venture with Humana for senior clinics","src":"Reuters","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOankxMG9JbDMtRWc4S2NtZ19xN3BOdDdmVWprTHc5Tk9kTURWWGo3TTRqelFGSno1eGQwbk1iTnNBTUxFTFF5SV9Hczk2VnBsZ01HSHFWR1RzdVEzR0NHLXVIVnI2VUNPOXd4VzNfUUd3NkNaa0tXMDctdjJCeE1MMlA3MXBGbkN1ZEMxZTV4UGdsdGJZeFNtNlVoN1BsQ2stY2pGcndWQVhDRnRBOFBQZQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-13","zh":"BlackRock 與 Humana 合資成立老年診所，取代 WCAS"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/49071/000004907126000009/hum-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Headquartered in Louisville, Kentucky, Humana Inc. and its subsidiaries, referred to throughout this document as \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" the \"Company\" or \"Humana,\" is committed to putting health first – for our teammates, our customers, and our company. Through our Humana insurance services, and our CenterWell health care services, we make it easier for the millions of people we serve to achieve their best health – delivering the care and service they need, when they need it. These efforts are leading to a better quality of life for Medicare and Medicaid participants, families, individuals, military service personnel, and communities at large.","zh":"Humana Inc. 及其子公司總部位於肯塔基州路易斯維爾，在本文件中統稱為“我們”、“我們的”、“公司”或“Humana”，致力於將健康放在第一位——為了我們的隊友、我們的客戶和我們的公司。透過我們的 Humana 保險服務和 CenterWell 醫療保健服務，我們讓我們服務的數百萬人更輕鬆地實現最佳健康——在他們需要時提供他們所需的護理和服務。這些努力正在為醫療保險和醫療補助參與者、家庭、個人、軍人和整個社區帶來更好的生活品質。"},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, we had approximately 15 million members in our medical benefit plans, as well as approximately 4.7 million members in our specialty products. During 2025, 83% of our total premiums and services revenue were derived from contracts with the federal government, including 14% derived from our individual Medicare Advantage contracts in Florida with the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services, or CMS, under which we provided health insurance coverage to approximately 1.0 million members as of December 31, 2025.","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的醫療福利計劃擁有約 1500 萬會員，我們的特色產品擁有約 470 萬會員。 2025 年，我們總保費和服務收入的 83% 來自與聯邦政府的合同，其中 14% 來自我們在佛羅裡達州與醫療保險和醫療補助服務中心 (CMS) 簽訂的個人 Medicare Advantage 合同，根據該合同，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們為約 100 萬會員提供健康保險。"},{"en":"Humana Inc. was organized as a Delaware corporation in 1964. Our principal executive offices are located at 101 East Main Street, Louisville, Kentucky 40202, the telephone number at that address is (502) 580-1000, and our website address is www.humana.com. We have made available free of charge through the Investor Relations section of our web site our annual reports on Form 10-K, quarterly reports on Form 10-Q, current reports on Form 8-K, proxy statements, and, if applicable, amendments to those reports filed or furnished pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act, as soon as reasonably practicable after we electronically file such material with, or furnish it to, the Securities and Exchange Commission.","zh":"Humana Inc. 成立於 1964 年，是一家特拉華州公司。我們的主要執行辦公室位於 101 East Main Street, Louisville, Kentucky 40202，該地址的電話號碼為 (502) 580-1000，我們的網站地址為 www. humana.com。在我們以電子方式向美國證券交易委員會提交或提供此類資料後，我們會盡快透過網站的投資者關係部分免費提供我們的 10-K 表年度報告、10-Q 表季度報告、8-K 表當前報告、委託書，以及根據《交易法》第 13(a) 條提交或提供的報告的修訂（如果適用）。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our two reportable segments, Insurance and CenterWell, are based on a combination of the type of health plan customer and adjacent businesses centered on well-being solutions for our health plans and other customers. Our Chief Executive Officer, the Chief Operating Decision Maker, utilizes these segment groupings and results of each segment, measured by income (loss) from operations, to assess performance and allocate resources primarily during our annual budget process and periodic forecast updates. For additional information on our business segments and","zh":"我們的兩個可報告部門，保險和 CenterWell，是基於健康計劃客戶類型和以我們的健康計劃和其他客戶的福祉解決方案為中心的相鄰業務的組合。我們的首席執行官，首席營運決策者，利用這些部門分組和每個部門的結果（以營運收入（損失）衡量），主要在我們的年度預算流程和定期預測更新期間評估績效和分配資源。有關我們業務部門的更多資訊以及"},{"en":"segment financial information, refer to Note 18 to the audited Consolidated Financial Statements included in Part II, Item 8, \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data\" of this Form 10-K.","zh":"分部財務資訊，請參閱本表 10-K 第二部分第 8 項「財務報表和補充數據」中經審計的合併財務報表附註 18。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We use various methods to market our products, including television, radio, the Internet, telemarketing, wholesale distributors (general agencies) and direct mailings.","zh":"我們使用各種方法來行銷我們的產品，包括電視、廣播、網路、電話行銷、批發經銷商（總代理商）和直郵。"},{"en":"At December 31, 2025, we employed approximately 1,000 sales representatives, as well as approximately 2,200 telemarketing representatives who assisted in the marketing of Medicare products, including Medicare Advantage and PDP, and specialty products in our Insurance segment, including making appointments for sales representatives with prospective members. We have a marketing arrangement with Walmart Inc., or Walmart, for our individual Medicare stand-alone PDP offering. We also sell group Medicare Advantage products through large employers. In addition, we market our Medicare and individual specialty products through licensed independent brokers and agents. For our Medicare products, commissions paid to employed sales representatives and independent brokers and agents are based on a per unit commission structure, regulated in structure and amount by CMS. For our individual specialty pro","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們僱用了約 1,000 名銷售代表以及約 2,200 名電話行銷代表，他們協助行銷 Medicare 產品（包括 Medicare Advantage 和 PDP）以及保險部門的特殊產品，包括與潛在會員預約銷售代表。我們與沃爾瑪公司 (Walmart Inc.) 就我們的個人 Medicare 獨立 PDP 產品達成了行銷安排。我們也透過大型雇主銷售團體 Medicare Advantage 產品。此外，我們還透過獲得許可的獨立經紀人和代理商來行銷我們的醫療保險和個人特色產品。對於我們的 Medicare 產品，向受聘銷售代表以及獨立經紀人和代理人支付的佣金基於每單位佣金結構，並由 CMS 監管結構和金額。對於我們的個人專業專業人士"}],"competition":[{"en":"The health benefits industry is highly competitive. Our competitors vary by local market and include other managed care companies, national insurance companies, and other HMOs and PPOs. Many of our competitors have a larger membership base and/or greater financial resources than our health plans in the markets in which we compete. Our ability to sell our products and to retain customers may be influenced by such factors as those described in Part I, Item 1A, \"Risk Factors\" of this Form 10-K.","zh":"健康福利業競爭激烈。我們的競爭對手因當地市場而異，包括其他管理式醫療公司、國家保險公司以及其他 HMO 和 PPO。在我們競爭的市場中，我們的許多競爭對手比我們的健康計畫擁有更大的會員基礎和/或更多的財務資源。我們銷售產品和留住客戶的能力可能會受到本表 10-K 第 I 部分第 1A 項「風險因素」中所述的因素的影響。"},{"en":"Diverse legislative and regulatory initiatives at both the federal and state levels continue to affect aspects of the nation's health care system, including the Health Care Reform Law at the federal level and laws in certain states limiting the entry of new providers or services though a certificate of need, or CON, process.","zh":"聯邦和州層面的各種立法和監管舉措繼續影響著國家醫療保健系統的各個方面，包括聯邦層面的醫療保健改革法和某些州通過需求證明（CON）流程限制新提供者或服務進入的法律。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Insurance","val":124563000000,"zh":"保險部門"},{"name":"Center Well","val":22473000000,"zh":"中心井段"}],"total":129664000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"External Revenues","val":128658000000,"zh":"外部收入"},{"name":"Service","val":5833000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":129664000000}},"peers":["CI","CNC","HCA","UNH","MCK"]}}